The '''Blue Whale''' is a {{Skl|fishing}} Pet that can be bought from {{NPCSprite|Oringo;Oringo the Traveling Zookeeper}} during the [[Traveling Zoo]] event. It focuses on {{Stat|HP}} and is one of the best pets for '''[[Effective Health|tanking]]'''. The {{Legendary}} variant of this pet provides a large amount of {{Stat|HP}}, which is useful against {{MobSprite|Skeleton Master}}s in The {{Skl|Catacombs}} [[The Catacombs - Floor VI|Floor VI]] and [[The Catacombs - Floor VII|Floor VII]] because they deal massive amounts of {{Statname | tdmg}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Blue Whale Pet''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Oringo;Oringo the Traveling Zookeeper}} during the [[Traveling Zoo]] event. Its price is dependent on its [[Rarity]].
