== Trivia ==
* On initial release (26 February 2020), it used to make players gain {{Stat|Def|1}} for every {{Stat|HP|0.3}} points instead of {{Green|1}} for every {{Red|30}}, letting people that were using {{Item|Mastiff Armor}} have more than 90,000 {{Stat|Def}} (99.9% damage reduction), making them nearly invincible, with {{Stat|EHP}} over 1000x what's normally possible. Players with {{Item|Strong Dragon Armor|text=Dragon Armor}}s at the time could also easily exceed {{Stat|Def|5,000}}. Its {{AN|Archimedes}} ability used to still pair well with the {{Item|Mastiff Armor}}, which gave tons of {{Stat|HP}} until {{Changelog|0.26.1|alt=0.26.1}}.

